 Hello from New York City. God bless Amtrak.

 Headed to AUSA next week? Give us a shout! I'll be there Oct. 12. Thomas will be there Oct. 13-14. ⚓ Situational awareness: Anduril Industries will construct Arsenal-2 in Baltimore County, Maryland. Parts for Virginia-class submarines are expected to be built at the mega-shipyard, which is backed by almost $4 billion in private capital. President Trump spoke about it yesterday afternoon.

 Can't stop won't stop: Talking to tanks, questioning Golden Dome and landing F-16s in Taiwan.

 Today's newsletter is 1,784 words, a 6.5-minute read. 

 
 
